  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Media 4 Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this Action is to strengthen resilience of fragile societies to  harmful content online by supporting the establishment of multi-stakeholder collaborations (social media platforms, Internet governance and regulatory bodies, conflict prevention and peacebuilding stakeholders) in four pilot countries (BiH, Colombia, Kenya, Indonesia) and at the global level, while enhancing the promotion of peace through digital technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
